# Ars Magica Definitive Edition, City & Guild — Chapter Four: Crafts (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** City & Guild (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Chapter Four (pp. 61–79)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> Chapter Four’s narrative, verbatim: craftsmen and laborers, the workshop and its Innovation
> and Raw Materials scores, the Workshop Total and the five qualities of finished goods,
> wondrous items, assistants, manuals and workshop exertion, reputations, selling, damaged
> goods, and locks and keys. Mechanics are records elsewhere:
> `armdef-city-and-guild-0.5-crafts-virtues.ttrpg`, `armdef-city-and-guild-0.5-crafts-wondrous-items.ttrpg`,
> `armdef-city-and-guild-0.5-crafts-exertion-results.ttrpg`, `armdef-city-and-guild-0.5-crafts-spells.ttrpg`,
> `armdef-city-and-guild-0.5-crafts-tables.ttrpg` and `armdef-city-and-guild-0.5-crafts-sidebars.ttrpg`.

